'''Primal Aegis''' is a [[active skill|skill]] granted by the [[Bastion of Elements]] ascendancy passive in the [[Elementalist]] skill tree.

==Mechanic==
*It's triggered automatically when available, has no duration and does not cost any mana.
*While the Aegis is active, it takes elemental damage from hits before other resources, such as {{il|Molten Shell}}'s buff, [[energy shield]], or [[life]].<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3008270</ref> This still counts as damage taken by the player for the purpose of [[recoup]] or {{il|Cast when Damage Taken Support}}. 
*The Aegis will be restored to full if it doesn't take elemental damage from hits for 5s.
**This delay cannot be interrupted while depleted. 
*Its value is equal to 75 multiplied by number allocated [[notable]]s, including ascendancy notables.

